WEBVTT

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:07.940
This time, I'll make you disappear for good.

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:09.270
Dodge, Chuta.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.140
They disappeared?

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:16.270
What?

00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:18.020
Chuta, your shoulders.

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:18.780
Huh?

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.300
Wings?

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.180
Wow!

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:30.910
We can move faster than before!

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:36.050
The evolved abilities of a Monitalien 
usually would reset when it switches hosts,

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:39.340
but when it goes back to a host, they remain.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:44.050
This is the phenomenon called 
a Monitalien's update.

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:46.930
Though I'm the one that 
started calling it that.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:50.010
This is the update...

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:55.850
We can do this.

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:00.340
Chief Laine.

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:01.850
What's the matter?

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:04.620
What's the rookie from Division 2 like?

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:05.840
Chuta?

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:08.460
Why don't you find out for yourself 
with this cooperative plan?

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:10.450
I want to hear your opinion, Chief.

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:15.630
Well... If he's able to secure 
Dr. Love with no issues,

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:19.050
he probably won't win your favor.

00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:21.960
Not as a police officer or a man.

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:24.440
That sounds pretty bleak.

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:25.420
But...

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:31.220
If you guys run into some real trouble, 
his core will be really reliable.

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:33.060
Core?

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:40.980
I think I might understand what 
the chief was trying to say now...

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:14.590
<b>Something to Believe in: Part 3</b>

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:22.220
We're able to move so fast that it looks
 like her attacks are barely moving.

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:25.510
So are you just going to keep running away?

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:29.790
We can't just keep running away.

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:30.890
Apparently.

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:35.130
Sewing up won't work, Chuta.

00:03:35.390 --> 00:03:38.670
I know. But there's gotta be a way.

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:43.310
I was so scared of her SPH earlier, 
but now I'm not scared at all!

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:44.980
I agree.

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:50.330
Hey, Chuta. Looking at it now, 
doesn't Ninotchka's attack

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.320
look like a vegetable?

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:53.280
A vegetable?

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:59.500
You might be a little faster now, 
but you're still just as weak!

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:04.750
Just as you said, 
those do look like vegetables.

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:07.260
They almost looks like... green onions!

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:09.060
Sympathy!

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:11.680
Round slice!

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:17.310
No...

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:29.700
Impossible! To think that he'd 
be able to stop my plan...

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:33.220
That means I have no use 
for this girl anymore.

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:34.740
I'll make her bite her tongue off!

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:35.710
Huh?

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:37.290
That's not happening.

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:46.660
Officer Ninotchka?

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:55.530
I removed the remote control SPH 
with this fixed SPH remover beam.

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:57.980
She doesn't have any major 
injuries, so she's fine.

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:01.900
So she's back to normal...

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:03.420
Thank goodness.

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:07.150
Oh, yeah. What about everyone else?

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:12.270
I treated the blue shrimp and the 
Kushutonian girl, so they're both fine.

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:13.530
When did you...

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:18.650
There are medical supplies 
behind the walls and floor of this facility.

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:21.850
If we hadn't been here, 
she wouldn't have survived.

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:24.550
Assistant Inspector Veronica...

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:26.520
I didn't undress her.

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:28.160
I know that!

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:31.850
Oh, I need to treat 
the long-haired girl, too.

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:37.130
If Dr. Love wasn't here, Veronica 
would have died. Love is a good guy.

00:05:37.130 --> 00:05:39.780
Yeah, we owe him our lives.

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:42.740
But he's sort of off.

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:44.830
By the way...

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:49.870
When I measured the remote control SPH,

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:53.620
the estimated time when she absorbed it 
was only two hours prior.

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:54.820
Do you have any ideas?

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:59.580
Huh? Two hours ago, we still hadn't 
left the <i>Jeanrenoi-R.</i>

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:03.580
Does that mean that the culprit 
was within the bureau?

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:06.670
In order to use the 
remote control SPH on someone,

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:10.180
they have to come in contact with the person 
and concentrate on them, as well.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:11.810
But how...

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:13.760
However, there is the matter of compatibility,

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:16.560
so not everyone it was used on 
will be controlled.

00:06:17.260 --> 00:06:20.940
There's a possibility that it was used 
on you, too, but it had no effect.

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:22.450
Really?

00:06:22.450 --> 00:06:24.740
I can think of various ways 
it could have been done.

00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:28.570
For example, having to look at 
someone in the eyes at close range.

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:30.980
Look someone in the eyes?

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:33.780
Could it be...

00:06:34.180 --> 00:06:36.570
Investigator Belalugo's subordinate!

00:06:36.570 --> 00:06:40.410
Then it was when Officer Ninotchka 
was being interrogated?

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:43.210
Who would've thought that 
the interrogator was the culprit?

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:45.010
We have to tell Chief Laine!

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:47.450
Understood.

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:51.420
Well done, Chuta. I'll send 
a rescue squad right away.

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:52.760
Take care of everyone.

00:06:56.420 --> 00:06:59.680
Deputy Chief Riggs. This is a Code 9.

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:00.910
Code 9?!

00:07:00.910 --> 00:07:03.640
The code for capturing a dangerous
 individual within the bureau?!

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:06.820
We will immediately arrest 
Investigator Belalugo's subordinate,

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:09.360
Dali Lime, on suspicion
 of murder and espionage.

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:11.920
That guy was the culprit?

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:14.900
Yoyosa! I'll dispatch a squad to arrest him.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:21.570
Enter.

00:07:22.180 --> 00:07:26.160
Investigator Belalugo, there's an 
emergency message from Chief Laine.

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:27.910
What does he want?

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:31.630
Wh-What?

00:07:33.630 --> 00:07:35.800
Dali, what are you...

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:38.800
I'll be taking your authority as an investigator.

00:07:43.800 --> 00:07:46.180
Authority as an investigator 
has been transferred.

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:51.770
For crying out loud... you were such 
a foolish boss to the end, Belalugo.

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:56.320
The emergency line to the investigator 
was forcibly cut off.

00:07:56.730 --> 00:07:59.320
Are any of the squads heading 
to the investigator's room?

00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:01.820
Squad 4 should be there soon.

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:04.090
This is Squad 4. An incident has occurred!

00:08:04.090 --> 00:08:06.250
We are being attacked by Officer Lando.

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:13.340
This is Squad 1! Officer Taro 
has suddenly gone berserk!

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:16.380
What in the world is going on?

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:19.700
They're just being controlled 
by the remote control SPH!

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:21.390
If you have to fight back, 
don't harm them!

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:22.390
But...

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:24.260
I know it's difficult!

00:08:24.260 --> 00:08:28.650
Are you sure that kind of leisurely countermeasure 
is going to work, Mr. Chief?

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:33.570
At this rate, everyone's going 
to follow Belalugo to hell.

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:34.640
McClane?

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:38.870
I'm telling you that Dali-sama 
is going to control the personnel

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:41.620
in the bureau one by one 
and kill everyone!

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:43.370
Ow!

00:08:43.740 --> 00:08:45.640
You were the only one upside down, Chuta.

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:46.750
Why?

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:51.950
I corrected the transferring data before we left, 
but apparently I forgot to fix yours.

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:53.510
There's trouble, shero!

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:56.640
Some of the personnel are being controlled 
and attacking others, shero!

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:57.460
What?!

00:08:57.460 --> 00:08:59.960
They're saying that they're 
going to kill everyone, shero!

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:01.980
They're bluffing.

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:02.860
Huh?

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:08.540
Only five percent of those who have been put 
under the remote control SPH can be controlled.

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:11.440
There's no way they can kill 
everyone with that many.

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:13.190
Then...

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:15.990
The culprit has a different motive.

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:17.240
Different?

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:22.010
The culprit said that he was going to open 
the gate to some treasure with my brain, right?

00:09:22.010 --> 00:09:25.390
Right now, he's trying to 
get hold of that gate.

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:30.120
Gate? Dr. Love, what is the gate?

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:34.260
Have you ever heard of 
the Taklamakan Project?

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:38.890
We must hurry. She's in danger.

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:41.420
Chief! More personnel are being controlled.

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:45.430
Now all of the squads are dealing with 
personnel who are being controlled.

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:48.870
This isn't good. Dali is controlling 
people indiscriminately...

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:51.140
What's his motive?

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:56.210
Chief... A door's been opened 
with the investigator's authority.

00:09:56.210 --> 00:09:57.300
It's the detention center!

00:09:57.300 --> 00:09:58.150
The detention center?

00:09:59.220 --> 00:10:03.520
<i>From what was being said earlier, 
Dali's already killed Belalugo.</i>

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:06.410
<i>He must've stolen the
 investigator's authority then.</i>

00:10:07.060 --> 00:10:09.690
<i>Could Dali's true motive be...</i>

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:12.870
<i>Then the timing of everything 
would make sense!</i>

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:15.400
Which squad is closest 
to the detention center?

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:18.500
Squad 3. They're currently 
fighting in Hall 72.

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:22.170
Even if they were to make a detour, 
the shortest route would take ten minutes.

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:25.090
<i>Crap! He's totally got us.</i>

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:27.100
Chief!

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:33.060
It's time to go, Great Gate to the Treasure.

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:35.850
We're finally able to be alone together.

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:43.350
I was going to have Dr. Love open the gate 
with his medical techniques,

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:45.990
but that brat got in the way.

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:50.100
But I'm going to open up this gate,
 no matter what it takes...

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:51.330
Which means

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:55.840
your memories that have been locked away.

00:10:56.200 --> 00:11:00.470
Don't worry. Dr. Love isn't 
the only scientist around.

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:04.590
Even if I have to over medicate you 
or chop up your brains,

00:11:04.590 --> 00:11:06.730
I'm going to obtain it...

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:08.090
Wha—

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:12.320
Get away from Sonokata!

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:23.950
<b>Taklamakan Strange Love</b>

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:27.030
It's you again...

00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:29.190
Dolugh! We're going to block the jail!

00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:30.660
Then we're doing that one thing, right?

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:33.290
I'm not going to give up 
when I've come this far!

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:34.920
Crochet!

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:39.470
It's hot!

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:43.840
Damn it! I won't be able to 
win against him with my SPH!

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:45.840
He's running away, Chuta!

00:11:45.840 --> 00:11:46.550
Hold it!

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:51.850
Chief Laine?!

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:53.850
Is there a spacesuit that 
I can use immediately?

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:56.640
Uh, where are you going?

00:11:57.160 --> 00:11:59.230
I'm gonna take a little walk.

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:01.420
You're not going to catch me!

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:03.150
You're not getting away!

00:12:04.460 --> 00:12:05.880
Identified.

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:13.750
Someone likely to be Dali and another 
just went through the emergency exit.

00:12:13.770 --> 00:12:16.670
Identifying the badge. 
It's Officer Kokonose!

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:17.750
Chuta...

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:19.120
That kid...

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:22.700
He's going down Hall 46 in pursuit of Dali.

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:26.010
Damn that Dali... He's planning on 
using an escape pod to escape.

00:12:26.940 --> 00:12:29.090
But that location is currently...

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:34.470
This is farewell!

00:12:34.470 --> 00:12:35.180
Hold it!

00:12:35.180 --> 00:12:36.740
Identified.

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:39.150
Farewell!

00:12:40.390 --> 00:12:41.400
Wha...

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:44.270
The outside?!

00:12:44.270 --> 00:12:46.190
Whoa, outer space!

00:12:46.190 --> 00:12:46.990
Vacuum!

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:50.940
This isn't good... The air...

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:57.830
You can do it, Dolugh!

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:12.720
The suspect, Dali Lime, has been 
ejected into space from Hatch 46.

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:15.720
His death has been confirmed. He suffocated.

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:16.950
What about Chuta?

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:18.980
<i>Chuta is fine.</i>

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:20.270
That voice...

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:21.980
Chief Laine!

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:26.810
Chief, that attire... Did you 
go outside to get Chuta?

00:13:26.810 --> 00:13:32.440
I see. It would be easier to get there from the 
outside when all that panic was going on inside.

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:34.450
We did it!

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:40.030
Um... Chief...

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:41.910
Sonokata's spying charges...

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:47.440
You brought back Dr. Love safely. 
All of that will be cleared up.

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:49.420
Thank goodness...

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:52.360
Jeez. You overdid it.

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:58.690
Well done on getting rid of the spy 
and securing Dr. Love.

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:01.070
Because you were able to 
find the true culprit,

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:03.900
the charges against Officer Sonokata 
have been dropped.

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:06.010
I will allow her to go back to the field.

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:07.480
But Assistant Commissioner...

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:11.060
This was a decision from above. 
There's nothing to argue.

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:12.530
And...

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:14.280
Dr. Love.

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:16.490
I feel like I'm in a dream.

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:20.370
It's been a while. You've changed, Kieshi.

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:22.210
Not as much as you.

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:25.060
Nah, you've definitely changed more.

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:29.720
In the past, you were a stuffy police officer who wasn't 
afraid to bite anyone if you weren't satisfied.

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:32.870
Now you're just spouting drivel

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:37.270
akin to the dirty water that would come out
 if you wrung ēlDLIVE like a giant rag.

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:38.970
You can go that far?

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:40.690
My friend,

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:45.320
I am looking out for you. 
You should hide in a safe facility—

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:48.980
Are you going to try to force this 
old man to some boring place again?

00:14:49.510 --> 00:14:51.480
Then I'd rather be here.

00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:55.180
There are many curious things 
about this bureau.

00:14:55.960 --> 00:15:01.530
For example, the Monitalien-like organism 
and one of the subjects of my project.

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:03.670
That is too dangerous.

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:10.760
Who knows when another will appear to try
 to access Misuzu Sonokata's memories?

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:13.720
How long are you going 
to keep up that farce?

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:19.230
I've told you more than once that I can 
return Misuzu Sonokata to a healthy state

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:21.850
and return her memories to her.

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:26.310
The ones who keep making her 
a Level 50 patient are you people.

00:15:27.520 --> 00:15:30.540
That is not our decision. It is Mothers'.

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:33.400
I have no plans to go against Mothers.

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:37.530
I'm just saying that it's safer 
that I stay by her side.

00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:41.120
Because I know more about 
Misuzu Sonokata's body than anyone else.

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:45.670
For example, you probably 
don't know that Chuta Kokonose

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:48.460
is affecting her condition a bit, do you?

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:50.630
Chuta is?

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:54.540
Despite how he looks, 
Kokonose is rather interesting.

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:58.130
I'm pretty sure that Dolugh 
needs Kokonose for a reason.

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:03.390
Very well. Laine-kun, 
please take care of Dr. Love.

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:04.830
Yoyosa.

00:16:05.490 --> 00:16:07.770
But give him bodyguards.

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:10.190
You mean people to monitor me, 
not bodyguards, right?

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:13.520
Step aside!

00:16:13.520 --> 00:16:15.530
There are a lot of people hurt.

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:20.540
I want to ask Dr. Isaac how Assistant Inspector 
Veronica and Officer Ninotchka are doing, but...

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:22.520
Looks like they're busy right now.

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:25.420
I heard they've both 
regained consciousness.

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:27.150
Sonokata...

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:29.910
Apparently, it's thanks 
to Dr. Love's treatment.

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:32.130
They're both asleep right now.

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:34.300
I see. Thank goodness.

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:38.220
Chuta, be careful. Misuzu doesn't 
know that she's a subject

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:42.060
of the Taklamakan Project, 
or that she was being targeted.

00:16:44.950 --> 00:16:52.350
Dali Lime was plotting to use Dr. Love to get 
Misuzu's sealed memories all along.

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:57.200
And it was right around that time 
that Misuzu had let a prisoner escape

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:58.910
because of the side effects of her medicine.

00:16:59.470 --> 00:17:02.530
Dali found out about that 
and put his plan into action.

00:17:02.530 --> 00:17:07.950
Officially, this has been taken care of 
as an attempt at ransom and espionage.

00:17:07.950 --> 00:17:11.760
You and I are the only ones in the
 bureau who know the truth.

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:15.040
This is a secret to Veronica, Ninotchka 
and of course Misuzu.

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:19.800
Chief, what are these memories of 
Sonokata's that Dali was after...

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:23.210
Sorry, that's top secret.

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:28.640
<i>In the end, I still don't know 
a lot of the important things...</i>

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:30.270
<i>But...</i>

00:17:30.810 --> 00:17:34.830
<i>Sonokata's right here. 
That's good enough for now.</i>

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:40.810
Um... Good job on securing Dr. Love.

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:41.850
Yeah.

00:17:41.850 --> 00:17:44.860
I'm sorry for all the trouble I caused you 
with the "suspicion of being a spy" thing.

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:46.330
No problem at all!

00:17:48.280 --> 00:17:51.200
I heard that the Monitalien was updated.

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:54.960
Yeah, he looks a little different now, too.

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:57.460
Um... You're really close.

00:17:57.460 --> 00:17:59.720
Look right here! See? See?

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:05.270
Hopefully you'll be able to update soon, 
and not just the Monitalien.

00:18:06.510 --> 00:18:10.600
Argh! After I risked my life fighting...

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:11.770
Wait up!

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:13.080
What?!

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:17.020
Y-Your attitude! Why are you 
so pissy with me?

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:20.010
I'll be more careful in the future. 
Is that enough?

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:23.150
No, it's not! If you have something 
you want to say, just say it!

00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:26.660
Then I'll tell you honestly.

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:37.790
Your SPH...

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:39.790
Compared to before...

00:18:42.400 --> 00:18:43.420
It stinks more.

00:18:43.420 --> 00:18:46.840
Stinks... Stinks... Stinks...

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:46.850
<b>Stinks</b>

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:49.520
If you'll excuse me.

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:53.850
No way... I...

00:18:54.290 --> 00:18:56.640
...stink?!

00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:00.230
Have a good day!

00:19:00.230 --> 00:19:02.060
See you later.

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:06.360
I love you, Chuta! Watch out for cars.

00:19:07.070 --> 00:19:09.530
I wonder what's going on with Chuta.

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:12.920
He took a bath for over an hour yesterday...

00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:16.170
Then he used my perfume without telling me.

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:19.920
I wonder if all boys are like this 
when they're going through puberty.

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:22.170
Good morning, chu!

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:24.180
Good morning.

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:30.550
M-Morning... Um... why are we meeting 
at the Earth's local branch today?

00:19:30.550 --> 00:19:32.520
There's something we have to do there, chu.

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:34.170
Sniff, sniff.

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:37.640
I smell something strong 
from Officer Kokonose, chu.

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:41.320
It's a perfume that 
Earthlings use... for ladies.

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:43.440
<i>She figured you out.</i>

00:19:43.860 --> 00:19:49.640
Um, Assistant Inspector Chips, 
has the smell of my SPH changed?

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:53.450
Hm? Your SPH smells the same as usual, chu.

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:59.520
I was mistaken the other day. 
Please don't let it bother you.

00:19:59.520 --> 00:20:00.580
I apologize.

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:04.630
You were mistaken? Then... I don't stink?

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:06.030
No.

00:20:07.090 --> 00:20:09.500
But you've got nose plugs in!

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:14.230
They aren't nose plugs. They are nose 
accessories that Tykwerians use in rituals.

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:15.890
But your nose is plugged up.

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:17.720
Chuta, look!

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:19.600
Oh, looks like they're here, chu.

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:21.860
Wh-Wha...

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:23.080
Hey.

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:26.430
I can finally thank you, Chuta Kokonose.

00:20:26.430 --> 00:20:29.240
Thank you very much for the other day.

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:32.890
Why are the three of you 
wearing my school's uniform?

00:20:32.890 --> 00:20:36.700
Because we're all on the team that's going to be 
working from the same local branch on Earth, chu.

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:37.880
Team?!

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:43.740
Dr. Love will be our scientific research backup 
and also keep us healthy, chu.

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:47.880
Investigation Division 5 
is in charge of guarding Dr. Love.

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:49.010
Guarding?

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:50.870
Basically, we're keeping an eye on him.

00:20:50.870 --> 00:20:54.010
Dr. Love is a very important scientist.

00:20:54.470 --> 00:20:57.780
Well, you heard her.
 I look forward to working with you.

00:20:58.290 --> 00:20:59.870
I believe this is the 
first time we've met...

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:02.520
Officer Sonokata.

00:21:02.520 --> 00:21:04.860
N-Nice to meet you...

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:05.440
Huh?

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:10.370
Oh, yeah. Sonokata doesn't remember 
anything about the Taklamakan Project,

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:12.540
so this is supposed to be 
their first meeting.

00:21:13.770 --> 00:21:17.290
If Sonokata and Dr. Love 
are at the same school...

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:20.410
All of the students have gone home.

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:22.290
Yes, Dr. Love.

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:26.010
Now, it's time for today's Taklamakan Project.

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:28.260
Yes, Dr. Love.

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:30.650
Now, take off your clothes.

00:21:30.650 --> 00:21:33.230
Yes, Dr. Love.

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:35.780
Damn it!

00:21:35.780 --> 00:21:38.510
Pretty sure it's not what 
you're thinking, Chuta.

00:21:38.850 --> 00:21:39.960
Is something wrong?

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:41.180
Is he okay?

00:21:41.180 --> 00:21:43.190
He seems rather tired.

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:44.650
This is normal.

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:47.410
All of us are at the same school...

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:52.510
What's going to happen?

00:23:25.860 --> 00:23:27.900
You're very fancy, Dr. Love.

00:23:27.900 --> 00:23:31.310
But I'm only interested in the 
body's structure and organs.

00:23:31.980 --> 00:23:33.360
I want to touch their raw flesh.

00:23:33.360 --> 00:23:34.550
Ninotchka, will you undress for me?

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:36.810
Next time on <i>ēlDLIVE,</i>

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Next Time
Misuzu's Lie</b>

00:23:36.810 --> 00:23:37.820
"Misuzu's Lie."

00:23:37.820 --> 00:23:39.650
Th-That's pretty raw!
